16. JavaScript Include 3 Main Ways

1. Inline JavaScript
JavaScript written directly inside an HTML element's event attribute.

<button onclick="alert('Hello')">
    Click
</button>


2. Internal JavaScript
JavaScript written inside the <script> tag within the same HTML document.

<script>

    alert("Hello");

</script>

3. External JavaScript--:

JavaScript written in a separate .js file and linked using the src attribute.

<script src="script.js" defer></script>
JavaScript ko separate .js file mein likhkar HTML se connect karna.

